        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by the redundant setting of missing dependencies in the `CoordActionInputCheckXCommand` class, which could lead to incorrect handling of the coordinator action's state when there were no dataset definitions in the coordinator job XML. This redundancy likely resulted in the coordinator action being incorrectly marked as having missing dependencies, causing it to remain in a WAITING state instead of transitioning to the appropriate status.

        Commit message:
        OOZIE-1179

